abstract: "Data, code and figures behind a short thesis on PUMP (pump.fun) for the Franklin Crypto Research Competition, UBC 2026: a 16-day collector run on pump.fun (Oct 5-20, 2026), a 17-day run on Arc factory pools, bot campaign reconciliation, and the public API responses used for valuation."
